<p>I have answered your questions in the form of an edit to the document (you can see them by the 'edit' tag, alongside the italics)</p>
<p>As for the one question i didnt answer (at least- not directly)</p>
<blockquote>
<p>i'm probably not getting this right, but what do you mean by entering through the top?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>i explain this further when saying:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Edit lmao: However, viewed from above, it looks more akin to the image i have hopefully attached.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>essentially, you are only able to enter the wormhole while you are positioned ABOVE it. if you were in a plane, for example, and flew <em>upwards through</em> the cloud, you would not teleport through it. However, if you were in a plane and flew <em>downwards through</em> it, its property would work and you would appear on the other side.</p>
<p>I hope this helps!</p>

